---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<PageLayout title="About" description={`Learn about ${SITE.name}, our mission, and the author behind the articles.`}>
  <header class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl">About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-muted">
      We publish clear, practical guides for developers, freelancers, and anyone building on the web.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose-content">
    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} exists to cut through noise. The web is full of shallow listicles and outdated
      tutorials. We focus on evergreen topics — static sites, productivity, and modern development
      workflows — explained in plain language with steps you can follow today.
    </p>

    <h2>Who writes here</h2>
    <p>
      Hi, I'm {SITE.author}. {SITE.authorBio} I started this site to document solutions I actually use
      in my work and to help others ship faster without unnecessary complexity or cost.
    </p>

    <h2>What you'll find</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Step-by-step tutorials with real examples</li>
      <li>Honest reviews of tools that save time</li>
      <li>Beginner-friendly explanations of technical concepts</li>
      <li>No fluff, no filler — every article is written to be useful on its own</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Editorial standards</h2>
    <p>
      Every article is researched, written, and edited for accuracy. We update posts when tools or
      best practices change. If you spot an error, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> — we
      appreciate corrections.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} displays advertisements through Google AdSense to support free content. Ads are
      clearly separated from editorial content and never influence what we write about. See our
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details on how data is handled.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
